22%3A100%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1274%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E8%B6%85%E5%AF%BC%E9%87%91%E5%B1%9E%E6%B0%A2%22%2C%22count%22%3A220%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1140%2Fdetail%22%7D%2C%7B%22name%22%3A%22%E6%B5%81%E4%BD%93%E5%90%88%E9%87%91%E5%9D%97%22%2C%22count%22%3A18%2C%22url%22%3A%22%2Fbh3%2Fwiki%2Fcontent%2F1890%2Fdetail%22%7D%5D%7D%5D%7D%7D%5D\" data-ts=\"1681924137985\" data-col-type=\"l2r1\"><div style=\"order: 0;\"> <div data-part=\"info\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--info obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h1>武器数据</h1> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method obc-tmpl-weapon__info-table\"><colgroup><col> <col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-avatar\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/04/01/50494840/09e103c7b0966bbe9fd1be53f51b952e_8352423858493465736.png\" alt=\"\"></td> <td class=\"h3\">星级</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-stars\"><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">攻击</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">439</td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">会心</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\">21</td></tr></tbody></table> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__info-desc\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">那是绝对统一的彼岸，一切存在的源流。当它仍然以寂静无声的姿态存续时，理念交织而成的梦境，也会生出状如永恒的棘刺，如同回响的先兆。正于此地，她第一次睁开了自己的双眼。这罕有他例的生灵踏足世间，行过万有，而后这样说着——「我相信人类的美丽，恰恰源自他们的谬误。」</p></div> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">百相转踅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定，角色于【六合执驭】状态下，武器获得额外强化效果</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">使用武器主动技能后角色自身的物理伤害提高12.0%，持续5秒，重复触发可刷新。织羽梦旌装备时，本体使用武器主动技能后回复5.0点能量，最短触发间隔为5秒，精神实体使用武器主动技能后，蓄力攻击造成的暴击伤害提高25.0%，持续5秒，重复触发可刷新</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">始端真无</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">普通攻击（包括分支和蓄力）造成的物理伤害提高12.0%，【六合执驭】状态下，上述强化物理伤害提高变为35.0%，普通攻击（包括分支和蓄力）造成的暴击伤害提高25.0%</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">自在纯有</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">角色造成全伤害提高20.0%，场上生成自身召唤物后，角色回复300点生命值，每10秒可以触发一次</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"forging\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--forging obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>悬赏锻造</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">超限素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/2366/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><img src=\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2023/04/01/50494840/04c3bd56311a1dd9b0f5bdf4f3ae4035_243052313630836790.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"obc-tmpl__icon\"><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">解锁「凡念梦兆」图鉴后任意梭镖蛋池武器</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div></div></td></tr> <tr><td class=\"h3\">其他素材</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"forging-other-material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1274/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">爱因斯坦环磁机</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*100</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1140/detail\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">超导金属氢</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tm